<title>USA: U.S. meat output up 3.8 pct from week ago - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. meat output up 3.8 pct from week ago - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Red meat production for week ending Saturday, Jan 25, rose 3.8 pct at 845.2 million lbs.-USDA</p>
<p>WEEK ENDING/1  BEEF   CALF/VEAL   PORK/2 LAMB/MUTTON TOTALS/3</p>
<p>25-Jan-97	498.7     7.0	 335.1	4.4	845.2</p>
<p>18-Jan-97	488.3     6.9	 315.0	4.0	814.2</p>
<p>Change:	    2.1%    1.4%	  6.4%    10.0%	3.8%</p>
<p>27-Jan-96	479.8     6.5	 353.3	5.4	845.0</p>
<p>Change:	    3.9%    7.7%	 -5.2%   -18.5%	0.0%</p>
<p>1997 YTD:     1710.6    23.8	1113.1     14.4     2861.9</p>
<p>1996 YTD:     1893.9    25.3	1341.8     19.3     3280.3</p>
<p>Change:	   -9.7%   -5.9%	-17.0%   -25.4%    -12.8%</p>
<p>LIVESTOCK SLAUGHTER (HEAD)</p>
<p>WEEK ENDING   CATTLE   CALVES/VEALERS     HOGS     SHEEP/LAMBS</p>
<p>25-Jan-97     728,000	   35,000     1,787,000	68,000</p>
<p>18-Jan-97     722,000	   34,000     1,678,000	61,000</p>
<p>Change:	   0.8%	     2.9%	    6.5%	 11.5%</p>
<p>27-Jan-96     677,000	   31,000     1,896,000	85,000</p>
<p>Change:	   7.5%	    12.9%	   -5.7%	-20.0%</p>
<p>1997 YTD:   2,522,000	  119,000     5,929,000     223,000</p>
<p>1996 YTD:*  2,663,000	  120,000     7,170,000     305,000</p>
<p>Change:	  -5.3%	    -1.6%	  -17.3%	-26.7%</p>
<p>AVERAGE WEIGHTS (LBS.)</p>
<p>WEEK ENDING  LIVE CATTLE   CALVES/VEALERS   HOGS  SHEEP/LAMBS</p>
<p>25-Jan-97    Est    1162	  338	   257	  131</p>
<p>18-Jan-97    Est    1154	  347	   258	  131</p>
<p>27-Jan-96    Actual 1188	  344	   255	  126</p>
<p>Dressed</p>
<p>25-Jan-97    Est     689	  204	   188	   65</p>
<p>18-Jan-97    Est     680	  206	   188	   65</p>
<p>27-Jan-96    Actual  712	  213	   187	   63</p>
<p>FOR THE WEEK PERCENTAGE OF TOTAL CATTLE SLAUGHTERED BY CLASS</p>
<p>ENDING	 STEERS	HEIFERS     COWS     BULLS &amp; STAGS</p>
<p>11-Jan-97     45.9%	 30.0%	22.3%	  1.7%</p>
<p>13-Jan-96     48.8%	 29.7%	19.8%	  1.8% FOR</p>
<p>THE WEEK PERCENTAGE OF TOTAL HOGS SLAUGHTERED BY CLASS</p>
<p>ENDING	BARROWS &amp; GILTS	    SOWS     STAGS &amp; BOARS</p>
<p>11-Jan-97     95.7%			3.6%	   0.7%</p>
<p>13-Jan-96     95.5%			3.8%	   0.7%</p>
<p>*1996 slaughter totals adjusted to reflect NASS revisions.</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 YTD reflects six production days.</p>
<p>1997 YTD reflects four production days</p>
</text>
